+  <section class="journal container" aria-labelledby="journal-heading">
+    <h2 id="journal-heading">Roaster's Journal</h2>
+    <div class="journal-text" id="journal-text">
+      <p>Every bag we roast begins months before it reaches our shop, usually at a long wooden table in a small
+        cooperative's cupping room. Our head roaster travels to our partner regions each harvest, tasting dozens of
+        lots side by side and talking with the farmers who grew them. We look for sweetness, clarity, and balance, but
+        we also look for people we want to work with for years rather than a single season.</p>
+      <p>We buy directly from cooperatives and family farms in Ethiopia, Colombia, and Guatemala whenever we can, and
+        we pay well above the Fairtrade minimum. Those premiums are agreed on before the harvest, so farmers can plan
+        their year, invest in drying beds and washing stations, and pay pickers fairly. Many of our relationships are
+        now longer than a decade, and a few of the farms have become friends.</p>
+      <p>Once green coffee lands at our warehouse, we roast small test batches and cup them again to confirm that the
+        flavors we loved at origin survived the journey. Lots that fall short are declined, and we tell the producer
+        why. Lots that pass are roasted in small batches here in town, rested for a few days, and bagged with the
+        roast date on the label so you always know how fresh your coffee is.</p>
+      <p>Sourcing this way is slower and costs more, and some seasons we simply run out of a favorite. We think that's
+        a fair trade for coffee that tastes like somewhere, and for a supply chain where everyone, from the hillside to
+        the counter, gets a fair share.</p>
+    </div>
+    <div class="journal-actions">
+      <button type="button" class="btn" id="summarize-btn" hidden>Summarize</button>
+    </div>
+    <p class="journal-status" id="summarize-status" role="status"></p>
+    <div class="journal-summary" id="summary" hidden>
+      <h3>In short</h3>
+      <ul id="summary-list"></ul>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
   <footer>
